&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience deploying software on ROS 2, DDS (e.g., CycloneDDS, FastDDS), or ZeroMQ in bandwidth-limited environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Practical knowledge of embedded compute environments (e.g., NVIDIA Jetson, ARM-based platforms) and real-time kernels (RT-Linux).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Prior engineering experience in aerospace, autonomous driving, robotics, or defence industries.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
