&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Forward Deployed Software Engineering (FDE) Manager, you will lead a high-performing team building solutions for customers&#39; data and AI challenges using the Databricks platform. Your team will own the architecture, lead design decisions, rapidly prototype and implement end-to-end systems spanning apps, AI and data. Our focus is to combine engineering expertise with adaptability, curiosity, and a passion for working with customers and teammates to build solutions that drive measurable outcomes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The impact you’ll have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the successful delivery of customer outcomes through high-quality FDE execution, as measured by key metrics including bookings, revenue, CSAT and impact on consumption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connect your team’s day-to-day work to real customer outcomes and business impact. Build excitement about Databricks FDE by sharing customer wins and delivery successes, making each individual feel motivated and appreciated&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hire strong Software Engineer/FDE/Full Stack talent using structured interviews and practical delivery scenarios. Grow the team by ensuring continuous technical learning and experimentation. Understand your team’s strengths and growth areas to provide regular coaching, address performance gaps promptly by offering actionable feedback and maintaining clear accountability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reinforce your team’s top delivery priorities. Help your team focus on high-impact technical work, redirecting effort away from low-value tasks and using customer impact, delivery data and KPIs to confirm focus areas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply your own builder and AI-first mindset to improve team productivity. Remove delivery blockers quickly, using automation or AI assistants to accelerate routine work. Run consistent inspection rhythms (standups, project reviews, retrospectives) and hold teammates strictly accountable to timelines and quality bars&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate Databricks’ culture principles (Customer Obsessed, Truth Seeking, First Principles, Raise the Bar, Company-First, Bias for Action) into concrete day-to-day behaviors, ensuring standards are upheld in all customer interactions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review delivery plans and architectures utilising practical knowledge of SWE/FDE/Full Stack approaches. Actively coach ICs on secure, scalable deployment patterns, governance, and production readiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
