&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 8+ years of total technical experience with 2+ years of experience managing, leading, or mentoring high-caliber, AI-first, Software Engineering, Full Stack or Forward Deployed Engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Depth:&lt;/strong&gt; Enough technical depth to engage on architecture and trade-offs with senior and staff engineers, and to hold a high-quality bar for our customer-facing outputs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Track Record: &lt;/strong&gt;Evidence of leading, building and shipping tools/apps/platforms used by many end users, delivered using production-grade approaches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven ability to manage technical project delivery, timelines, scoping, conflict resolution, and executive customer relationships from technical ICs up to Director level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comfort with Ambiguity: &lt;/strong&gt;Experience leading teams through ambiguity, with competing priorities from customers, partners and platform dependencies, and making clear calls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
